{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_1_level_main_01-07_beg",
  "groupId": "main_1",
  "stageId": "main_01-07",
  "title": "暴君",
  "storyCode": "1-7",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_01-07_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "e8acd76214e0f011927789795158fe564d5b540ba7491adecb4c19a4ed319697",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第十关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cher_10"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抗衝擊準備！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "各自散開——！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "規模太大了......這樣下去，整個街區的建築都會被徹底摧毀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不行，糟了———！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerId": "char_014_riope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerId": "char_014_riope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快轉移！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerId": "char_014_riope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "堅持住！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊——！！掉，掉下來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天空掉下來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，不，啊好疼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的手，我的手！我的手哪裡去了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎，怎麼會！！我不想死......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊啊啊啊！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "重裝幹員！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "保護我方術師！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是什麼聲音？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerId": "char_014_riope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "巨大的墜岩擊垮了臨街的建築！臥倒！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——那個位置——醫生！危險！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "糟糕，醫生，快閃開！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......唔，博，博士？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士把醫生推進了掩體？可這樣......這樣的話，博士——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，博士！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Dr.{@nickname}！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "臨，臨光她衝出去了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，蹲下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "趕上了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她救下......她救下博士了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳哈......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "臨光！博士！快回來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒問題的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的盾牌還撐得住——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "跳啊，博士！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "跳！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，博士......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你，你沒事吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我沒事，這算不了什麼！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "多虧臨光小姐救下了我。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一個人......處在那樣的危險中！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至少拉上我一起，讓我保護博士你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無論怎樣，我都不能允許你受傷——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "何況，是在我面前！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大家都還安全，就非常好了......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我們......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（還要堅持多久呢？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（我們真的能活下來嗎？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "墜石的數量減少了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們撐過了第一波主災害了嗎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還不能大意，誰知道這次的天災會持續多久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過至少......我們不是身處天災正中心的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們僥倖躲過去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大家怎麼樣了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幹員們基本都沒事......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有些幹員受了輕傷，但狀況都還算不錯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們......活下來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "整合運動也有部分人員——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......啊！！羅德島！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "整合運動還要繼續攻擊我們嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "羅德島！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這些傢伙！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別跑......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的是瘋了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這些人為什麼就不能珍惜自己的生命？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "杜賓......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有辦法......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "徹底擊潰他們，然後馬上移動！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
